{
  "_comment": [
    "One short conversation, chosen so every row shape the timeline skeleton can",
    "draw appears exactly once: a human bubble, an assistant reply, a run capsule",
    "with an error in it, a thinking-only run, a Brain turn, a system notice, an",
    "ask card, an image and a file, a block type this build has never heard of,",
    "and the marker for a turn that ended without a reply.",
    "",
    "These are RAW messages — the same shape chat.listMessages returns — so they",
    "go through FoldRuns.fold on the way to the screen rather than posing the",
    "rows by hand. What is being looked at is what the fold decided.",
    "",
    "Every instant is SECONDS BEFORE now, never a timestamp: a fixture with dates",
    "baked in silently becomes a different conversation every day."
  ],
